{
  "description": "The creature is shown in right-facing side view standing on a small patch of bare ground with sparse dry vegetation. It has a stout, low-slung, quadrupedal body with a broad flattened head at the right end, a thick tapering tail extending to the right behind the body, and four short thick limbs ending in splayed clawed feet. The dorsal surfaces of the head, back, sides, and tail are covered in overlapping rounded dark gray-brown scales with lighter edges, while the throat, belly, and underside of the tail are smooth and pale cream with faint transverse banding. Just behind the head on the neck are several feathery, filament-fringed stalks protruding outward. The head has a blunt snout with a small reddish nostril, a large round eye with a dark pupil and light iris, and a closed mouth with a pale lower jaw. The overall appearance is that of a heavily armored amphibian-like animal.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "broad, flat and blunt-snouted, facing right, with a large round eye with dark pupil and light iris on the side, a small reddish nostril near the tip of the snout, and a closed mouth with a pale cream lower jaw and throat; the top and sides of the head are covered in overlapping dark scales",
      "where": "at the right end of the body, connected to the neck just in front of the feathery stalks"
    },
    {
      "part": "gills",
      "looks_like": "five feathery external gill stalks with dense hair-like filaments along their edges, gray-brown with reddish-brown fringes; three larger stalks are clearly visible on the near side of the neck, two smaller stalks protrude above the back on the far side",
      "where": "arising from the neck immediately behind the head, projecting outward and upward"
    },
    {
      "part": "scales",
      "looks_like": "overlapping, rounded, plate-like scales, dark gray-brown with lighter reflective edges, arranged in diagonal rows giving an armored appearance",
      "where": "covering the dorsal top of the head, the entire back and sides of the body, and the dorsal surface of the tail"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four short, stout, smooth-skinned gray limbs, thick and muscular, bent at the joints to support the low body",
      "where": "two forelegs under the chest and two hind legs under the rear of the belly; the near-side foreleg and hind leg are fully visible in profile, the far-side legs are partially visible behind the belly"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "broad feet with five splayed toes each, each toe tipped with a small dark pointed claw; the skin is smooth gray",
      "where": "at the ends of each leg, flat on the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "thick, muscular and tapering, about half the body length, dark scaled on the dorsal side and pale cream with faint transverse striping on the ventral side, ending in a blunt point",
      "where": "extending horizontally straight back from the rear of the body to the right"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "countershaded coloration with no spots; dark gray-brown scaled dorsum contrasting with pale cream unscaled venter on throat, belly and under-tail, with faint ventral banding and lighter scale edges",
      "where": "over the whole body, dark on top and sides, pale underneath"
    }
  ],
  "attached_objects": [],
  "animals": [
    "axolotl",
    "pangolin",
    "lizard"
  ],
  "separate_bodies": 1,
  "heads": 1,
